er a donor successfully makes a donation.\"},\"OwnershipTransferred(address,address)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted when contract ownership is transferred to a new admin address.\"},\"Withdrawal(address,uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted when the contract administrator withdraws collected funds.\"}},\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"constructor\":{\"notice\":\"Deploys the contract and assigns deployer as the initial owner.\"},\"donate(string)\":{\"notice\":\"Allows any user to contribute funds with a specified purpose.\"},\"getBalance()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the current Ether balance held by the smart contract (in Wei).\"},\"getDonation(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Retrieves the full record of a donation by its unique ID.\"},\"getDonationCount()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the total number of donations recorded to date.\"},\"getTotalDonated()\":{\"notice\":\"Returns the cumulative amount of Ether donated since inception (in Wei).\"},\"owner()\":{\"notice\":\"Authorized administrator / NGO account address.\"},\"totalAmountDonated()\":{\"notice\":\"Cumulative value of all donations received in Wei.\"},\"totalDonations()\":{\"notice\":\"Total number of donations recorded.\"},\"transferOwnership(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Transfers administrative ownership to a new address.\"},\"withdraw()\":{\"notice\":\"Allows the authorized owner to withdraw all funds currently held in the contract.\"}},\"notice\":\"Transparent, blockchain-based donation tracking smart contract.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"contracts/DonationTracker.sol\":\"DonationTracker\"},\"evmVersion\":\"osaka\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":false,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\"]},\"sources\":{\"contracts/DonationTracker.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xa79a01d5bcef2ae8a653bec978b1191b5146dc5825cbfb3eca77e48fad8d8131\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://c5b76748a2fdba32021740b235c021d736aa555970dbc0920a6468b0